{
  "text": "```systemverilog\nmodule edge_propagator (\n  input  logic clk_tx_i,\n  input  logic rstn_tx_i,\n  input  logic edge_i,\n  input  logic clk_rx_i,\n  input  logic rstn_rx_i,\n  output logic edge_o\n);\n\n  // State to track the last value of edge_i sampled in the TX domain\n  logic tx_edge_prev;\n  \n  // State to track the last value of edge_o sampled in the RX domain\n  logic rx_edge_prev;\n\n  // TX Domain: Sample the input edge and detect transitions\n  always_ff @(posedge clk_tx_i or negedge rstn_tx_i) begin\n    if (!rstn_tx_i) begin\n      tx_edge_prev <= 1'b0;\n    end else begin\n      tx_edge_prev <= edge_i;\n    end\n  end\n\n  // RX Domain: Detect transitions from the TX domain and propagate a single pulse\n  always_ff @(posedge clk_rx_i or negedge rstn_rx_i) begin\n    if (!rstn_rx_i) begin\n      rx_edge_prev <= 1'b0;\n      edge_o       <= 1'b0;\n    end else begin\n      // Detect a rising edge in the TX domain\n      if (tx_edge_prev == 1'b0 && edge_i == 1'b1) begin\n        // Rising edge detected in TX: assert pulse in RX\n        edge_o <= 1'b1;\n        // Update RX state to remember we just sent a pulse\n        rx_edge_prev <= 1'b1;\n      end else if (tx_edge_prev == 1'b1 && edge_i == 1'b0) begin\n        // Falling edge detected in TX: de-assert pulse in RX\n        edge_o <= 1'b0;\n        // Update RX state to remember we just cleared the pulse\n        rx_edge_prev <= 1'b0;\n      end else begin\n        // No edge detected in TX, maintain current RX state\n        edge_o       <= edge_o;\n        rx_edge_prev <= rx_edge_prev;\n      end\n    end\n  end\n\nendmodule\n```<|im_end|>\n<|endoftext|>",
